  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "统计局：10月工业生产增长4.8%，消费增长0.4%",
  "title_en": "Statistics bureau: October industrial output up 4.8%, consumption up 0.4%",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月16日，国家统计局公布了中国10月份的经济数据。10月，规模以上工业企业的增加值比去年同期增长了4.8%，比9月慢了0.7个百分点。规模以上工业企业是指一年收入在2000万元以上的工业企业。另外，服务业生产指数增长了4.6%。",
      "en": "On November 16, the National Bureau of Statistics released China's economic data for October. In October, value added at industrial companies above designated size grew 4.8% from the same period last year, 0.7 percentage points slower than in September. \"Industrial companies above designated size\" means industrial companies with annual revenue of 20 million yuan or more. In addition, the services production index rose 4.6%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在消费方面，10月社会消费品零售总额是46463亿元，比去年同期只增长了0.4%。把前10个月加在一起，这个数字增长了1.0%。",
      "en": "On the consumption side, total retail sales of consumer goods in October were 4.6463 trillion yuan, up only 0.4% from the same period last year. Adding the first 10 months together, this figure grew 1.0%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在投资方面，1到10月全国固定资产投资一共是364824亿元，比去年同期下降了8.1%。其中，房地产开发投资下降了21.6%。",
      "en": "On the investment side, national fixed-asset investment from January to October totalled 36.4824 trillion yuan, down 8.1% from the same period last year. Within this, property development investment fell 21.6%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在就业方面，10月全国城镇调查失业率是5.1%，比9月低0.1个百分点。国家统计局发言人付凌晖表示，10月中国经济总体平稳。他还说，10月消费增长变慢，主要是因为今年的中秋节和去年不在同一个月，而且一些耐用消费品卖得比以前慢。",
      "en": "On the employment side, the national surveyed urban unemployment rate in October was 5.1%, 0.1 percentage points lower than in September. NBS spokesperson Fu Linghui said China's economy was generally stable in October. He also said consumption growth slowed in October mainly because this year's Mid-Autumn Festival was not in the same month as last year's, and because some durable consumer goods sold more slowly than before."
    }
  ],
